<b>Background and mission of the requester.</b> I am a private individual a=
nd the subject of the records I am requesting. I maintain a public accounta=
bility record that documents how government agencies have handled, shared, =
and acted on my personal information.
 My requests exist to obtain the government's own documents and put them in=
 front of the public.</div>
<div style=3D"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: Aptos, &quo=
t;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helve=
tica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementTo=
Proof">
<b>Purpose for the records.</b> To obtain the County's records about me, to=
 learn what was disseminated to and by your Sheriff's Office, and to place =
those records on the public record.</div>
<div style=3D"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: Aptos, &quo=
t;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helve=
tica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementTo=
Proof">
<b>Plans and ability to disseminate.</b> Demonstrated, not promised. I alre=
ady operate a public archive that publishes agency correspondence and recor=
ds in full. The Oregon Parks and Recreation Department, the Oregon State Po=
lice, the Department of Administrative
 Services, the United States Forest Service, the Oregon Legislature, and th=
e Governor's office are already on it. As of today, so is this office.</div=
>
<div style=3D"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: Aptos, &quo=
t;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helve=
tica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementTo=
Proof">
<b>Public benefit.</b> The public has an interest in knowing when a federal=
 agent sends a private citizen's date of birth, driver's license number, ho=
me, schedule, and private messages to a county sheriff's office, and in how=
 that office handled it once it
 had them. Disclosure lets the public see the government's conduct in the g=
overnment's own words.</div>
<div style=3D"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: Aptos, &quo=
t;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helve=
tica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementTo=
Proof">
<b>Private benefit.</b> Yes. These are my own records and concern me direct=
ly. I am entitled to them on that basis alone, and my personal stake does n=
ot cancel the public interest in how they came to exist.</div>
<div style=3D"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: Aptos, &quo=
t;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helve=
tica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementTo=
Proof">
<b>Commercial purpose.</b> None. I sell nothing. The archive is free to rea=
d and carries no advertising.</div>
<div style=3D"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: Aptos, &quo=
t;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helve=
tica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementTo=
Proof">
<b>Ability to pay.</b> I decline to turn my own records into a means test. =
The records concern me, the request serves the public interest, and no fee =
is warranted. I am not going to negotiate a price for a file the County bui=
lt about me.</div>
<div style=3D"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: Aptos, &quo=
t;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helve=
tica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementTo=
Proof">
<b>Anything else.</b> The last records custodian that treated a lawful requ=
est as a negotiation produced nothing but a fully documented public record =
of its own obstruction. Produce my records in full, without cost, and witho=
ut delay, and there is nothing to
 document.</div>
<div style=3D"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: Aptos, &quo=
